```bash lucio command=execute show_source=false stdout=false stderr=false
# hidden block to ensure no files/directories used in the example below exist
rm -rf /tmp/cover.jpg /tmp/cover.jpg.json
rm -rf /tmp/audio.flac /tmp/audio.flac.json
rm -rf /tmp/o/
```

## Download

### Download Track

#### Download Track Albumart (Cover)

```bash lucio command=execute
# use the template defined in the configuration file
volumito track albumart
```

```bash lucio command=execute
# override the configuration file, use an explicit output path
volumito track albumart -o /tmp/cover.jpg
```

#### Download Track Audio

```bash lucio command=execute
# use the template defined in the configuration file
volumito track audio
```

```bash lucio command=execute
# override the configuration file, use an explicit output path
volumito track audio -o /tmp/audio.flac
```

